\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  My Redeemer and my Vanguard,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Almighty is Thy strength.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj There is nobody on this earth,
\par Save Thou Jesus alone.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Thou guide me through my life's journey.
\par And treat me fairly well,
\par In tempest and in deepest seas;
\par Thou never leave me in.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.  Thick darkness all over the earth,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 It is through that I trod
\par Thou knowest all about my peace,
\par And care for my distress.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thou guide me on my life's journey,
\par And fight for my redemption.
\par Thou createth peace path for me,
\par Thou weighs all my troubles.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. In trials and tribulations,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Thou art with me always,
\par Thou art my Rock which no torrent,
\par Nor tempest can remove.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thou hast said to me, "Be at peace;
\par And let your heart rejoice.
\par I'm your light within your darkness,
\par For I'm your Redeemer.\i                             \i0\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

